{"steam_appid":1430190,"steam_name":"Killing Floor 3","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1430190/413218103/34ffd0bfb79cc60ffda6f33b2092e092c16ca545/1784817318/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784820206","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257383269/1557c3ecdc7b5aece01cd213d9fe316cd3c84deb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784820206","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/ac70ff75eb8fff8c573463f3be4c16b64e015be8/ss_ac70ff75eb8fff8c573463f3be4c16b64e015be8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784912665","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/28d78747e65d3414764db9f982691f7e4fc57ebc/ss_28d78747e65d3414764db9f982691f7e4fc57ebc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784912665","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/75ac5e5c089e2dab1a09ed8fbe87c883feb6fe2a/ss_75ac5e5c089e2dab1a09ed8fbe87c883feb6fe2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784912665","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/608a040fb6ac647477e9355f1a9555d1c5b42f9f/ss_608a040fb6ac647477e9355f1a9555d1c5b42f9f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784912665","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/b4d81fcb5bfa6aab538354ff2b38a3f040d7fa76/ss_b4d81fcb5bfa6aab538354ff2b38a3f040d7fa76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784912665"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/8b3854ae0d2bb086b9a2c9cfb5bb6079.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/8b3854ae0d2bb086b9a2c9cfb5bb6079.webm?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/8b3854ae0d2bb086b9a2c9cfb5bb6079.mp4?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2091. Join up with Nightfall, the last line of defense against megacorp Horzine’s inhuman army of monstrous zeds. The future is in your hands… if you can survive long enough to reach it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Killing Floor 3</strong></i> is the next installment in the legendary action/horror series. This intense FPS puts you in the boots of a Nightfall specialist joining forces with up to five teammates to battle waves of Zeds, earn dosh, unlock skills, and build the ultimate arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/4ac4c191fc7629a5b59e7bd9b60f1498.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/4ac4c191fc7629a5b59e7bd9b60f1498.webm?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/9ce23beedb53e6fb97452b50870dc142.webp?t=1784912665\" width=332 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble the ultimate zed extermination squad for frenzied 6-player co-op. You can also brave the battlefield alone in tense single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/5c819ad059c902687d4c869fcc546771.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/5c819ad059c902687d4c869fcc546771.webm?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/14151138f18048bb689aa73f3d77086d.webp?t=1784912665\" width=418 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for the most lethal zeds yet. Every enemy has been redesigned and retuned with smarter AI; making them faster, deadlier, and more strategic than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/8255d2e87e44246bce491f27def4b2f4.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/8255d2e87e44246bce491f27def4b2f4.webm?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/f2d8b98c98fbe3f598fcb7b3ad37122c.webp?t=1784912665\" width=385 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flamethrowers to shotguns to katanas, you’ll have an expansive arsenal at your disposal. Customize your own unique brand of bloodletting with hundreds of mods, gadgets, and skills to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/628d61201f14036231fed5fbad2f2b4b.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/628d61201f14036231fed5fbad2f2b4b.webm?t=1784912665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/6805e1a25f2c33d4a9499d5c61bd4142.webp?t=1784912665\" width=582 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into a variety of treacherous hot zones where you’ll have to contain the further spread of the Outbreak. Thankfully, you can use the environment to your advantage by activating turrets, fans, and other devastating traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/c19fbbce14925124f17ea182fcc0aeb8.webp?t=1784912665\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/c19fbbce14925124f17ea182fcc0aeb8.poster.avif?t=1784912665\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=393 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430190/extras/993f4351e926330cfd3ea033d74735f2.webp?t=1784912665\" width=278 height=34 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our M.E.A.T. System returns to deliver even more realistic carnage. Featuring additional points of dismemberment and persistent blood, the game responds to your attacks with gruesome authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or Intel Core i7-4790<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060, AMD Radeon RX 480 or or Intel Arc A580 (6 GB Video RAM required)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 7700X or Intel Core i7-12700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6750 XT, GeForce RTX 3060 or Intel Arc A770 (8 GB of Video RAM Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required</li></ul>","genres":["Action"],"developers":["Tripwire Interactive"],"publishers":["Tripwire Interactive"],"release_date":"24 Jul, 2025"}